Orínate.

62
00:08:08.446 --> 00:08:09.447
¡No!

63
00:08:18.623 --> 00:08:19.749
No.

64
00:08:20.375 --> 00:08:21.418
¡No!

65
00:08:23.211 --> 00:08:24.379
¡No!

66
00:08:24.754 --> 00:08:25.755
¡No!

67
